{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17287","headline":"送安南裴都护 · 权德舆","name":"送安南裴都护","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽佩交州印，初辞列宿文。\n莫言方任远，且贵主忧分。\n迥转朱鸢路，连飞翠羽羣。\n戈船航涨海，旌斾卷炎云。\n绝徼褰帷识，名香夹毂焚。\n怀来通北户，长养洽南薰。\n暂叹同心阻，行看异绩闻。\n归时无所欲，薏苡或烦君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}